OL,3,GNEWSAHorse tram to run full length of
OL,4,Aprom by 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouglas Horse Tramway is expected to
OL,7,Frun the full length of the promenade by
OL,8,Fthe summer of 2028.
OL,10,FThe heritage transport currently
OL,11,Ftravels between Derby Castle and
OL,12,FBroadway ` about half of the 1.6-mile
OL,13,F(2.6km) tramway.
OL,15,FThe Department of Infrastructure (DoI)
OL,16,Fhas confirmed a construction programme
OL,17,Fis "provisionally" forecast to run for
OL,18,F35 weeks, with a tender for the works
OL,19,Fexpected to launch early next year.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
